===Etymology 1===
From {{inh|en|enm|kipe}}, {{m|enm|kype}}, from {{inh|en|ang|cȳpe}}, {{m|ang|cȳpa||basket}}, from {{der|en|gem-pro|*kipǭ}}, {{m|gem-pro|*kippǭ}}, from {{der|en|ine-pro|*gey-|t=to bend, twist}}.

Akin to {{cog|gml|kīpe}} {{gloss|"basket"; > {{cog|nds-de|Kiep}}, {{m|nds-de|Kiepke||basket}}, {{cog|de|Kiepe|t=carrying basket}}}}, {{cog|no|kaup||wooden box; crate}}.

====Noun====
{{en-noun}}

# {{c|en|Containers}} An [[osier]] basket used for catching fish.

